msgstr "429"

#: ../../docs/index.md:65 449844376b584bf49235167f0f639c77
msgid "23.6"
msgstr "23.6"

#: ../../docs/index.md:65 8d62afb5eae544d6b90f4007b61faf82
msgid "Pybes3"
msgstr "Pybes3"

#: ../../docs/index.md:65 f73b5bf8c75a4a99adc85d54c13a14ca
msgid "566"
msgstr "566"

#: ../../docs/index.md:65 b4b1db117199447f902d43afbe9e9676
msgid "24.3"
msgstr "24.3"

#: ../../docs/index.md:139 698d899d60da4eeb86e5e28a4cdd1b03
msgid ""
"`BOSS8` pays 55.2 µs per event, more than twice what the other readers "
"pay, because the Gaudi converters rebuild every collection in the "
"transient data store. The file is read once in all cases; the extra time "
"is the conversion, not the I/O."
msgstr ""
"`BOSS8` 每事件要付出 55.2 µs，超过另外两个读取器的两倍，因为 Gaudi converter 要在 transient data "
"store 中重建每个集合。三种情况下文件都只读取一次，多出来的时间是转换，而不是 I/O。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:141 2ab8e7b1fd4242b7bcce2f252957be0e
msgid ""
"Pybes3 is almost on top of plain `ROOT` at 24.3 µs per event against 23.6"
" µs. The few percent in between is the cost of building the awkward "
"arrays on top of the decoded data, while the decoding itself costs no "
"more than the generic ROOT object streamer, since the C++ kernels are "
"generated for the BES3 event layout."
msgstr ""
"Pybes3 的每事件耗时为 24.3 µs，与纯 `ROOT` 的 23.6 µs 几乎持平。两者之间的几个百分点来自在解码后的数据上构建 "
"awkward 数组的开销；由于 C++ kernel 是针对 BES3 事件布局生成的，解码本身并不比通用的 ROOT object "
"streamer 更贵。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:143 b283b37184064931b5931234a71cad7b
msgid ""
"Start-up goes the other way: Pybes3 spends 566 ms before the first event "
"against 429 ms for plain `ROOT`, mostly importing the module and loading "
"its kernels, and 658 ms for `BOSS8`, which also configures the event loop"
" and the persistency services. Start-up is paid once per job, so the per-"
"event column decides long jobs and this column decides short ones; either"
" way Pybes3 is twice as cheap per event as `BOSS8` and within a few "
"percent of plain `ROOT`."
msgstr ""
"启动开销则相反：Pybes3 在第一个事件之前要花 566 ms，纯 `ROOT` 为 429 ms，`BOSS8` 为 658 "
"ms。Pybes3 的这部分主要是导入模块和加载 kernel，`BOSS8` "
"还需要配置事件循环与持久化服务。启动开销每个作业只付一次，因此长作业由每事件耗时一列决定，短作业由这一列决定；无论哪种情况，Pybes3 "
"的每事件开销都只有 `BOSS8` 的一半，且与纯 `ROOT` 相差几个百分点。"

